@startuml components
' Allowed dependencies between code slices. tests/architecture.test.ts fails when the code
' depends on a slice through an arrow that is not drawn here. Update both together.
title SDD Studio — code slices

[Web client\napps/web] as web
[API and worker\napps/api] as api
[Shared domain\npackages/shared] as shared
[Publisher\napps/publisher] as publisher
[Agent runner\napps/agent-runner] as agent-runner
[Operational scripts\nscripts] as scripts

web --> shared : domain rules, schemas
api --> shared : domain rules, schemas
publisher --> shared : report model
agent-runner --> shared : policy types
scripts --> api : migrations, storage
scripts --> shared : canonical JSON

note bottom of shared
  No I/O, no frameworks:
  runs in the browser and on the server.
end note
@enduml
